{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18798","headline":"冬夜宴河中李相公中堂命筝歌送酒 · 刘禹锡","name":"冬夜宴河中李相公中堂命筝歌送酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朗朗鵾鸡弦，华堂夜多思。\n帘外雪已深，座中人半醉。\n翠蛾发清响，曲尽有余意。\n酌我莫忧狂，老来无逸气。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18798.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18798","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}